This file contains neutrino fluxes and uncertainties.
Order of the neutrino fluxes(unit: 10^10): pp,pep,7Be,8B,13N,15O,17F,hep
Order of the 3isgma uncertainties: Uncert11,33,34,17,114,ZX,lum,age,diffuse,Be7e,hep
There is a line describing the model which produced the neutrino
fluxes. Then the fluxes are given. Then N rows of uncertainties, which are 
defined in the code as = 1 + fractional uncertainty (3 sigma). The
input is terminated by a row of uncertainties that begins with a
negative number.
